Why AGPL
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

moltek bundles Strudel (@strudel/repl and its packages), which is licensed
AGPL-3.0-or-later. A distributed work containing it must carry the same terms,
so AGPL-3.0-or-later is not a preference here but a requirement inherited from
that dependency.


